# Relaxing landscape views from open vantage points, very slow drift (about 25-35 m over 40 s).
# The camera sits 6-25 m above the ground so the landscape is the subject and grass is only a strip
# along the bottom; look heights put the summit or ridgeline in the upper third.
# Dropped after three preview tries: teton (flat meadow and village), fuji (tree canopy), glencoe (open moor).

